   $q$Which detail best shows that the sparrows had a hard night after Brightwing refused them?$q$, $q$[{"text":"\"The sparrows had rebuilt their nest by then, small and plain.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-event"},{"text":"\"The sparrows huddled in a knot of roots at the bottom of the tree, and the rain fell all night.\"","is_correct":true},{"text":"\"Every corner is full.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"wrong-subject"},{"text":"\"A family of sparrows lived on the branch below.\"","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"irrelevant-detail"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$"The sparrows huddled in a knot of roots at the bottom of the tree, and the rain fell all night."$q$, $q$Huddling in roots while "the rain fell all night" shows how uncomfortable the night was. The rebuilt nest describes a later time, not the night of the storm.$q$, 'draft', '307deb04-66a0-5e03-8377-4cd6637e31ea')
